OL,3,GNEWSAPM promises meeting about brain
OL,4,Acancer fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has written to the
OL,7,Ffamily of a boy who died from brain
OL,8,Fcancer promising to raise further
OL,9,Fawareness of the condition with the
OL,10,Fhealth department.
OL,12,FMax Hall, 14, from Corby, was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith an "incurable" brain tumour last
OL,14,Fyear and died in August.
OL,16,FLee Barron, Labour MP for Corby and
OL,17,FEast Northamptonshire, raised the
OL,18,Fsubject of Max's death in Parliament
OL,19,Fand called on ministers to meet his
OL,20,Ffamily and other organisations.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
